{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVOLVE. FIGHT. CONQUER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against powerful teams of enemies, mutate your army of creatures and battle across a living world corrupted by mysterious Obelisks. Only you can stop <strong>Zoomalia</strong> from being destroyed by its own wild inhabitants.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT &amp; EVOLVE CREATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over\u00a0100 unique creatures living in<strong> Zoomalia </strong>ready\u00a0to tame, fuse, prestige and evolve!  <br>Each has unique abilities, traits and shiny forms.<br>Mix, match and experiment to create your own strongest possible deck \u2014 or discover wild new mutations along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153900/extras/4693b2e3ed22a65b1f66587cb204216e.poster.avif?t=1769009939\" width=762 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153900/extras/4693b2e3ed22a65b1f66587cb204216e.webm?t=1769009939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153900/extras/4693b2e3ed22a65b1f66587cb204216e.mp4?t=1769009939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRATEGY MEETS CHAOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map, every battle, every choice changes your experience in <strong>Zoomalia</strong>.<br>Explore randomized regions filled with narrative events, unique creatures and unique maps. <br>Destroy Obelisks to restore balance and unlock rare rewards and powerful creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET STRONGER EVERY MAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat wild creatures, gain XP and use DNA to unlock game changing powerups. <br>Prestige your deck, evolve your creatures and fuse them in the lab to create your own one of a kind creature. <br>Collect shiny trophies to gain permanent shiny bonuses and show off your bling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153900/extras/e9e95b81392b224c26d663b68bc2b410.avif?t=1769009939\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153900/extras_big/e9e95b81392b224c26d663b68bc2b410.avif?t=1769009939 width=1560 height=1018 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE FRIENDS &amp; THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or challenge others online!<br>Climb leaderboards, show off your rarest creatures, and prove you\u2019re the ultimate strategist.<br>Your team. Your deck. Your way to conquer <strong>Zoomalia</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153900/extras/c5dae23eca9f75c579a06c3408d6bbbc.avif?t=1769009939\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153900/extras_big/c5dae23eca9f75c579a06c3408d6bbbc.webp?t=1769009939 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ collectible and evolvable creatures (Yes evolutions completely change appearance)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fusion, mutation and prestige systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical card-based battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps &amp; roguelite progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerup shop with permanent upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online  PvP battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode for infinite replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shiny trophies, stats, and achievements</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepage